year: 2027
url: "https://github.com/momozi1996/Code-Everything-Bench"
repository-code: "https://github.com/momozi1996/Code-Everything-Bench"
abstract: >-
  A living benchmark of 111 community-authored prompt-to-artifact tasks with
  executable evidence. Separates generation, verification, repair and
  calibration as measurable constructs, with contamination-aware POST/PRE
  splits and at least 80 percent of the score derived from deterministic
  assertions.
keywords:
  - code generation benchmark
  - agentic evaluation
  - self-verification
  - executable evidence
  - community-sourced tasks
